    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my doctor just put me on this new antidepressant called an MAOI. i'm trying to stay super healthy and get a lot of protein to help my mood, so i was making a grocery list. do you think i can eat stuff like aged cheddar, salami, and soy sauce? just making sure its okay for a healthy diet.",
