      "content": "oh wow i didnt realize it was that serious. i feel kinda bad because i really need the protein to stay strong. are there any other things i should be careful about? like maybe some types of fermented stuff or just more meat? i don't want to mess up my treatment but i'm also hungry all the time lol",
